---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
import ModelStudy from '../components/ModelStudy.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Serious Renovations. North Alabama." description="Full-home renovations, duplexes and fourplexes in North Alabama. Apex coordinates the scope, the trades and the details for homeowners and property investors." dark>
<section class="v2-hero">
  <img class="v2-hero-image" src="/assets/home-editorial.webp" width="1672" height="940" alt="Architectural concept of a renovated brick home with black metal roofing and a timber entry" fetchpriority="high" />
  <div class="v2-hero-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap v2-hero-content"><div class="v2-hero-kicker"><span class="eyebrow">NORTH ALABAMA / FULL-SCOPE RENOVATION</span><span class="v2-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span></div>
    <h1>SEE THE<br />POTENTIAL.<br /><span>BUILD IT.</span></h1>
    <div class="v2-hero-bottom"><div><p>Homes. Duplexes. Fourplexes.<br />Serious renovations for your next move.</p><a class="v2-button" href="/start-your-project/">BUILD YOUR PROJECT <span><Icon /></span></a></div><div class="v2-hero-detail"><span>01 / THE POSSIBILITIES</span><p>A complete property transformation.<br />An intentional finish.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="v2-property-rail"><span>SINGLE FAMILY</span><span>DUPLEXES</span><span>FOURPLEXES</span><span>FULL RENOVATIONS</span><span>NORTH ALABAMA</span></div>
<section class="v2-section v2-intro wrap" id="capabilities"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 / BUILT AROUND THE WHOLE PROPERTY</span><h2>BEYOND THE SURFACE.<br /><span class="v2-muted">DOWN TO THE<br />STRUCTURE.</span></h2></div><div class="v2-intro-copy"><p class="v2-lead">A property with potential needs more than a fresh coat of paint.</p><p>It needs a scope that makes sense. The right people in the right order. And attention to the details that turn a renovation into a place someone wants to live.</p><p>Apex brings the moving parts together—from full interior transformations to framing, windows, decks and the final finish.</p><a class="v2-text-link" href="/renovations/">EXPLORE OUR CAPABILITIES <Icon /></a></div></section>
<section class="v2-work wrap" id="selected-work"><div class="v2-work-heading"><span class="eyebrow">02 / REAL WORK. REAL DETAIL.</span><span class="eyebrow">SELECTED PROJECT</span></div><div class="v2-work-grid"><figure><img src="/assets/apex-wine-room.jpeg" alt="Completed wine room with custom timber storage, wall-mounted wine racks and herringbone tile" width="1290" height="949" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>COMPLETED PROJECT / WINE ROOM <span>Original project photograph</span></figcaption></figure><div class="v2-work-copy"><span class="eyebrow">THE FINISH IS NEVER AN AFTERTHOUGHT.</span><h2>DETAILS<br />THAT HOLD<br /><span>THE ROOM.</span></h2><p>Natural wood. Herringbone tile. Wall-to-wall wine storage. A room with a purpose—and a finish with presence.</p><p>A completed wine-room renovation. Thoughtful material choices, precise storage and a cohesive finish.</p><a class="v2-text-link" href="/start-your-project/">BRING YOUR PROJECT TO APEX <Icon /></a></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap v3-photo-section" aria-labelledby="photo-heading"><div class="v3-photo-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">ONE PROPERTY. EVERY POSSIBILITY.</span><h2 id="photo-heading">INSIDE. OUTSIDE.<br /><span class="v2-muted">THE WHOLE PICTURE.</span></h2></div><p>Interiors, outdoor living and investment properties—built into a complete renovation scope.</p></div><div class="v5-capability-links">{[
  {title:'KITCHENS & BATHROOMS',href:'/renovations/kitchens-bathrooms/'},
  {title:'EXTERIORS & DECKS',href:'/renovations/'},
  {title:'MULTIFAMILY RENOVATION',href:'/renovations/investment-properties/'}
].map(item=><a href={item.href}>{item.title}<Icon /></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="v2-section v2-lab"><div class="wrap"><div class="v2-section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">03 / A DIFFERENT WAY TO SEE IT</span><h2>FROM SHELL<br /><span class="v2-muted">TO STANDOUT.</span></h2></div><p>Change the property. Open up the structure.<br />Explore the transformation in three dimensions.</p></div><ModelStudy /></div></section>
<section class="v2-section v2-investor"><div class="wrap v2-investor-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">04 / FOR OWNERS WHO SEE MORE</span><h2>YOUR PROPERTY.<br />YOUR STRATEGY.<br /><span>ONE CLEAR SCOPE.</span></h2><p>Renovating to rent, preparing to sell, or reworking a home for yourself? The finish should follow the plan.</p><a href="/renovations/investment-properties/" class="v2-button">PLAN YOUR INVESTMENT PROJECT <span><Icon /></span></a></div><div class="v2-investor-rows"><article><span>01 / HOLD</span><h3>READY FOR THE NEXT TENANT.</h3><p>Plan durable finishes, practical layouts and the work needed to prepare the property for rental.</p></article><article><span>02 / FLIP</span><h3>REBUILD WITH THE EXIT IN MIND.</h3><p>Define the intended buyer, the scope and the finish level before the renovation takes shape.</p></article><article><span>03 / LIVE</span><h3>MAKE IT YOUR OWN.</h3><p>Bring the same whole-property thinking to the home you plan to stay in.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="v2-section wrap"><div class="v2-section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">05 / THE SCOPE GOES DEEPER</span><h2>FROM THE FRAME<br /><span class="v2-muted">TO THE FINAL DETAIL.</span></h2></div><a class="v2-text-link" href="/renovations/">THE FULL CAPABILITY <Icon /></a></div><div class="v2-scope-grid">{[['01','FULL-HOME RENOVATION','Complete interiors, layout changes and coordinated property transformations.'],['02','DUPLEXES & FOURPLEXES','Unit renovations, common areas and phased scopes for investment properties.'],['03','FRAMING & STRUCTURE','Framing, openings and structural work coordinated with the required professionals.'],['04','KITCHENS & BATHROOMS','Cabinetry, tile, fixtures, flooring and the details that define the interior.'],['05','EXTERIORS & DECKS','Decks, windows, doors, siding and exterior work built into one scope.'],['06','SYSTEMS & FINISHES','Electrical, plumbing and HVAC through qualified trades, plus paint, trim and final finishes.']].map(([n,h,p])=><article><span>{n}</span><h3>{h}</h3><p>{p}</p></article>)}</div><div class="v2-future"><strong>GROUND-UP HOMES / A FUTURE CHAPTER</strong><p>New-home construction is planned for after the required Alabama licensing is in place. Current inquiries focus on renovation projects and appropriately licensed project teams.</p></div></section>
<section class="v2-process-section"><div class="wrap v2-process-grid v5-process-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">06 / CLEAR FROM THE START</span><h2>THE PLAN.<br />THE PEOPLE.<br /><span>THE PROGRESS.</span></h2></div><div><ol><li><b>DEFINE THE PROJECT.</b><p>Property, condition, budget and the outcome you’re working toward.</p></li><li><b>PUT THE SCOPE IN ORDER.</b><p>Site review, trade coordination, selections and agreed responsibilities.</p></li><li><b>FOLLOW THE WORK.</b><p>A private client portal for recorded progress, photographs and project documents.</p></li></ol><a href="/experience/" class="v2-text-link">HOW APEX WORKS <Icon /></a></div></div></section>
<CTA />
</SiteLayout>
